        "layout": "text-bottom-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "**NEIGHBOR**\n\nTalk through the problem with someone (a neighbor / partner) to share viewpoints and narrow down possibilities.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/190642c81894c57fb4fb4fd2cbb951d4-snot-troubleshooting-two-shot-at-eye-level-slight-profile-angle-in-a--1.png",
        "key": "computer-systems-lesson3-onlineresources-1-c4575f2c-89c4-4fea-9958-6e355e5676f0"
      },
      {
        "text": "**ONLINE**\n\nSearch message boards, technical manuals, FAQs and other online resources to further narrow down possible solutions.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/60731bbc77531f9c6fd87d494a10c7f6-snot-troubleshooting-over-the-shoulder-close-up-angled-toward-a-lapto-1.png",
        "key": "undefined-6f520c00-abc2-4c6f-83cb-59fc2fee94bf",
        "typing": false,
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true,
        "layout": "text-top-left"
      },
      {
        "text": "**TECHNICAL EXPERT**\n\nAsk a technical or subject-matter expert that can provide guidance.\n",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/34bba51e4de5975877cd8ad372fcc757-snot-troubleshooting-wide-shot-low-angle-in-a-home-or-classroom-study-1.png",
